                        "form": "madrases"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cf52390c-16e2-3496-9073-fc274c31371d",
                        "entry_id": "79d90817-eba9-3341-b92d-b069e3b43166",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A brightly colored cotton fabric with a checked or striped pattern."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "554608d9-92fa-4004-b277-178651dae81f",
                                "sense_id": "cf52390c-16e2-3496-9073-fc274c31371d",
                                "text": "A black woman in blue cotton gown, red-and-yellow Madras turban […] crouched against the wall."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8edd84d8-1e62-4ff7-9b98-9187b8b7d06e",
                                "sense_id": "cf52390c-16e2-3496-9073-fc274c31371d",
                                "text": "The service makes available, during limited weekend hours, a handful of the company’s items—cargo shorts, tank tops, and the like—to the Hamptons house guest who discovers that he can’t make it to Monday without purchasing one of those weird madras patchwork blazers"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "247ef467-b494-4cbb-9627-e962c3d506a3",
                                "sense_id": "cf52390c-16e2-3496-9073-fc274c31371d",
                                "text": "In one area, however, I stick close to my roots: an unreconstructed loved of madras cloth. Madras (pronounced, in the US, with the emphasis on the first syllable) is a lightweight carded cotton cloth with a bright plaid pattern, first produced in and named for the Indian city now known as Chennai."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "53377a79-3ad6-39ff-9b7b-81665f984a13",
                        "entry_id": "79d90817-eba9-3341-b92d-b069e3b43166",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A large handkerchief of this fabric, worn on the head in the West Indies."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "64dc9615-e21b-36b2-86fa-b9c91d9aa035",
                        "entry_id": "79d90817-eba9-3341-b92d-b069e3b43166",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Alternative form of Madras (“type of curry”)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "alt-of",
                            "alternative",
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "80243fb3-e503-4dc6-a07f-51d8165aaa18",
                                "sense_id": "64dc9615-e21b-36b2-86fa-b9c91d9aa035",
                                "text": "Gerry ordered poppadoms and parathas and then he was interrupted by requests for vindaloos, chicken madrases and sag joshes, rice, raita and nan, from Priest, Morgan and Maria Grazia."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ac2a6f7a-e873-441e-9a93-74a1cc9ec91e",
                        "source_entry_id": "79d90817-eba9-3341-b92d-b069e3b43166",
                        "source_sense_description": "fabric",
                        "target_lang_word": "madras",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "madras",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0d1eaa3c-6c1c-3a08-8584-f0cb273a64db",
                                        "entry_id": "99510f0e-e4da-35fa-96cd-4a35215b6169",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Étoffe dont la chaîne est de soie et la trame de coton, et qui est ainsi nommée parce qu’elle a été fabriquée d’abord à Madras, ville de l’Inde."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9b892875-8d53-46e6-bcc7-927617ddc81f",
                                                "sense_id": "0d1eaa3c-6c1c-3a08-8584-f0cb273a64db",
                                                "text": "Un mouchoir de madras ou, simplement,"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c2057754-252d-4d64-9f01-3a3f5d904de2",
                                                "sense_id": "0d1eaa3c-6c1c-3a08-8584-f0cb273a64db",
                                                "text": "Un madras."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cd70e1dd-34f1-33a2-8f1b-0ec9209af017",
                                        "entry_id": "99510f0e-e4da-35fa-96cd-4a35215b6169",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Coiffe traditionnelle des Antillaises faite d’un mouchoir de cette étoffe."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Antilles"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "55e8b1cc-d1af-4f12-ac55-125e436eccfc",
                                                "sense_id": "cd70e1dd-34f1-33a2-8f1b-0ec9209af017",
                                                "text": "Une belle négresse avec un madras traversa l’antichambre, souriant et lui faisant une espèce de petite révérence fort encourageante."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6207da2c-e190-4e4d-ac4d-1f29748982b3",
                                                "sense_id": "cd70e1dd-34f1-33a2-8f1b-0ec9209af017",
                                                "text": "Là, dans cette rue non loin de la grande poste, la boutique d'une chanteuse parisienne en renom efface à tout jamais l'idée du foulard et du madras dans l'esprit des belles Foyalaises."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5313bb59-65ad-302b-a4b6-9f6dbb54ee36",
                                        "entry_id": "99510f0e-e4da-35fa-96cd-4a35215b6169",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Coiffe traditionnelle des Bordelaises."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1580b094-cdba-4435-b47e-e1dff2569f02",
                                                "sense_id": "5313bb59-65ad-302b-a4b6-9f6dbb54ee36",
                                                "text": "Leur coiffure est très-originale ; elle se compose d’un madras de couleurs éclatantes, posé à la façon des créoles, très en arrière, et contenant les cheveux qui tombent assez bas sur la nuque ; le reste de l’ajustement consiste en un grand châle droit qui va jusqu’aux talons, et une robe d’indienne à longs plis."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
